                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Another mixed result in the third of twelve annual federal funding bills in my Appropriations Committee, this one on our agriculture and nutrition assistance efforts. While it included many of my requests for Hawai\u2019i like invasive species and tropical/subtropical agriculture, I had to vote against it because it would cut food assistance for vulnerable families, critical programs for Hawaii farmers, and international efforts which are a key part of our national security.  https://t.co/w0sMuwsxM8",
